{%- comment -%}
Email HTML with inline CSS: only div, p, b, i, a, br and span survive, with a style attribute and an href to a link
of the view model. No colour on the body: the grey (#8a8a8a) and the link blue (#3b82c4) read on white and on dark.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture nl %}
{% endcapture -%}
<div style="max-width:600px;font-family:-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px">
{{- nl }}<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:19px"><b>⚠️ {% if schedule == "morning-digest" %}The morning digest could not be built{% else %}The schedule “{{ tool }} {{ schedule }}” is failing{% endif %}</b></p>
{{- nl }}<p style="margin:0 0 4px">{% if failures > 1 %}Failing since {{ since.date }}{% if since.time %}, {{ since.time }}{% endif %} · {{ failures }} runs in a row{% else %}Failed {% if at.day == "today" %}today{% elsif at.day == "yesterday" %}yesterday{% else %}on {{ at.date }}{% endif %}{% if at.time %} at {{ at.time }}{% endif %}{% endif %}</p>
{{- nl }}<p style="margin:0 0 12px">Why: {% case cause %}{% when "locked" %}the keyring was locked; unlock the computer{% when "sign-in" %}the account needs a new sign-in{% when "network" %}the service could not be reached{% when "provider" %}the service answered with an error{% when "setup" %}something is wrong in the settings{% when "stopped" %}the run was stopped{% else %}the program ended with an error{% endcase %}</p>
{%- for link in links %}{{ nl }}<p style="margin:0"><a href="{{ link.url }}" style="color:#3b82c4">{{ link.label }}</a></p>{% endfor -%}
{{ nl }}</div>
